test(crypto): expand handshake + snapshot-crypto edge coverage

Roadmap item 13 (partial — tenant jail already well-covered, this
commit thickens the handshake + snapshot-crypto suites).

handshake (+5 cases, 7 -> 12):
  - consecutive sign calls produce distinct nonces (replay defense
    sanity check)
  - HMAC differs across bodies (binding-to-body sanity)
  - 1 MB body verifies without truncation
  - non-numeric ts rejected (parseInt NaN path)
  - future skew >30s rejected symmetrically with past skew

snapshot-crypto (+4 cases, 9 -> 13):
  - empty buffer round-trips (boundary)
  - 1 MB payload round-trips (chunked AEAD path)
  - tampered nonce rejected (GCM auth failure surface)
  - tampered magic rejected with /magic/ error code (early reject)

Total lib tests now 80/0 (was 71/0).
Build: 510 modules. No production code touched.